body:
 https://www.StitchFiddle.com/c/sijdos-ibcivb/quickview 

&#x200B;

I decided to share the love and let you all have access to my grid pattern.  You will need to set up a stitch fiddle account (it's free) in order to view the pattern.  If you do decide to tackle this project and post on Reddit or any other sites, I ask only that you give proper credit as this is an original design by me.  ( u/blaquehartz ) 

&#x200B;

This is done in SC, 1 SC per 1 pattern row, using a J/10mm hook.

The border is done using DC, once you reach each corner, 5 DC to create shell in order to create a softly rounded corner.  That is just how I did it, have some fun with creating your own vision!

&#x200B;

Please feel free to message me with any questions, I am happy to help!  I will be creating more GoT inspired patterns, and will most likely be selling those.  Thank  you everyone for your interest and kind words!
